horizon-essentials is a port of EssentialsX (https://github.com/EssentialsX/Essentials) to Horizon.

EssentialsX is free software under the GNU General Public License v3.0 or later (GPL-3.0-or-later),
copyright the EssentialsX team and contributors. Its behaviour, messages (messages*.properties),
configuration files (config.yml, kits.yml, worth.yml, ...) and command/permission metadata (plugin.yml)
are used here, and generated into mixins/essentials/ess_messages.rs, ess_defaults.rs and ess_meta.rs by tools/ess-gen.

tools/horizon.py is adapted from horizon-native-mod-template (MIT).

